"https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974625_1148192935789997_1416656799652225989_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=faZRfP-V9cMQ7kNvwGtrVVE&_nc_oc=AdkFkeXInizQa6IqEkoKXLPCteVrxHjO9_woP8IXEutQK7bnKBRQ0RMBK4EUwW_yFGk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzbqGgqw7jyeI2PVw-NPdfZmOzdV8Wn06yRBmbicngDSQ&oe=69B6B736"}, {"file_name": "pd-screen-2.png", "id": "2332569856899945", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974820_2332569860233278_8835659424562109361_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mnf7Jr6S4MsQ7kNvwGjEHDP&_nc_oc=AdkqvKktWh2X91zCGUEsFzc4OO_17IfPMTu_SkojRJmegvrxXKQdNkSjyXFKlV6sRt8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwT1GUBGflnKLd9jh2T9SZf9w4Qx0K9NX-tP5rCAx7iRw&oe=69B68EB6"}, {"file_name": "pd-screen-5.png", "id": "430728135872291", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003247_430728139205624_5946641524650245644_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KAwHEeoN2A0Q7kNvwEHhved&_nc_oc=Adk2VjFm30nFcRlghaKHuEsm05jQ3yoA_pMpC8heZSG4kp2h-qExb2a0PCc2YlUoogM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwwejCF3RbkqHz46g5x5kcT_yUvl_cBRURITm8Pcs02og&oe=69B690E2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "videoscreen.png", "id": "986130542781323", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974594_986130546114656_4585000279316381076_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yiA7-94TgZAQ7kNvwHG2zol&_nc_oc=AdmpqQNFmT4YsB7p7RBYTCHNnrln-G7sHek3jqJoFQne4rLX1YyNAbW5fDDJfjUmxRg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyAtq-seM5CTOgQekqhn5OSiJKG44Ku_I_OZfE1wea8bw&oe=69B6BAAE"}, "display_name": "Paradiddle", "keywords": ["drum", "beat", "music", "piano", "instrument"], "long_description": "So much more than a VR drum kit. Learn to drum with step by step lessons, flex your skills with the built-in rhythm game, and build your own custom kit from a library of 60+ percussive instruments without the limitations of money or physical space. Fun, intuitive drumming for pros and newcomers alike!\n\nKey Features:\n- Flex your skills in the built-in rhythm game mode: adjustable difficulty for 30 different songs, plus custom song support and cross-platform leaderboards.\n- Create your custom drum kit from a library of 60+ percussive instruments, from mallet instruments like the xylophone and steel drum, to auxiliary percussion such as bongos, tambourines and timpanis.\n- Pick up the basics with 10 beginner-friendly lessons, perfect for drumming newcomers.\n- Use the new multiplayer mode to perform for your friends in free play, or compete to get the high score playing the built-in songs.\n- MR passthrough support empowers you to play virtual drums in the real world. You can even connect and augment your physical kit with the rhythm game mode and lessons.\n- MIDI input/output support provides a powerful tool for composers, and also lets you augment your own electronic drum kit.\n- Set the mood with 4 different environments: Dojo, Jazz Club, Galaxy, Void.\n- USB and Bluetooth pedal support for kick and hi-hat.\n- Load your own songs, audio files and sheet music.\n- Easily save/load different kits and record your jam sessions.", "short_description": "Play drums without the limitations of the real world.\n\nSo much more than a VR drum kit. Learn to drum with step by step lessons, flex your skills with the built-in rhythm game, and build your own custom kit from a library of 60+ percussive instruments without the limitations of money or physical space. Fun, intuitive drumming for pros and newcomers alike!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://paradiddleapp.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Emre Tanirgan", "support_website_url": "http://paradiddleapp.com/faq", "website_url": "http://paradiddleapp.com/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABL